# Keeps the upload to Google Cloud Build small and avoids leaking local
# secrets/artifacts into the build context (Docker COPY can only ever see
# what's not excluded here).

**/node_modules
**/.expo
**/dist
**/web-build
**/.git

# Real secrets - never uploaded. Cloud Run gets its env vars set directly
# in the service config instead (see CLOUD_RUN_DEPLOYMENT.md).
**/.env
**/.env.local
*.env
!*.env.example
paysharp_sandbox_credentials.txt
paysharp_production_credentials.txt

# Not needed at build/runtime - root-level docs/screenshots only (paths
# anchored with a leading "/" so this does NOT match mobile/assets/*.png,
# the app's own icons/splash images, which the web build needs).
/*.md
/*.csv
/*.xlsx
/*.xlsb.xlsx
/*.jpeg
/*.jpg
/*.png
/*.mmd
supabase/
.cursor/
